    "arm_A_also_moved_in_cells": 8,
    "why_arm_A_moves": "arm A ranks the WHOLE pool, probes included, not just the discovery trials. The discovery search is identical between designs -- same TPE seed, same 64 trials -- but one of the four anchor slots moved from the TPE ranking to a space-filling point, so eight probes now surround a different region. When the best in-sample objective in the pool was one of the probes that no longer exists, arm A's choice moves too. This comparison is therefore between two complete DESIGNS; it does not isolate arm B's behaviour, and neither arm should be described as invariant.",
