    },
    "reading": "space-filling coverage spends one of four anchor slots away from the region TPE favours. That region is where candidates tend to clear the economic gate, so broader coverage can COST eligibility rather than add it. Whether that is worth it is not decided by eligibility counts -- it is decided out of sample -- but the mechanism belongs in the record either way."
  },
